{"key":"enterprise/T1027","id":"T1027","name":"Obfuscated Files or Information","domain":"enterprise","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["stealth"],"platforms":["ESXi","Linux","macOS","Network Devices","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","network-infrastructure","onprem","virtualization"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may attempt to make an executable or file difficult to discover or analyze by encrypting, encoding, or otherwise obfuscating its contents on the system or in transit. This is common behavior that can be used across different platforms and the network to evade defenses. Payloads may be compressed, archived, or encrypted in order to avoid detection. These payloads may be used during Initial Access or later to mitigate detection.…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1027","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--b3d682b6-98f2-4fb0-aa3b-b4df007ca70a","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.708Z","source_object_version":"2.0","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc2d2c","page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"id":"DC0059","name":"File Metadata","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0059","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--639e87f3-acb6-448a-9645-258f20da4bc5","page":"telemetry/DC0059/"},{"id":"DC0061","name":"File Modification","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0061","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--84572de3-9583-4c73-aabd-06ea88123dd8","page":"telemetry/DC0061/"},{"id":"DC0085","name":"Network Traffic Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0085","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-com